### 测试文件上传

POST http://localhost:8080/api/dataset/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="student.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

name,age
Tom,20
Jack,21

--boundary--

### CSV 数据预览（默认返回前 10 行）

POST http://localhost:8080/api/dataset/preview?limit=10
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=preview-boundary

--preview-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="student.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

name,age
Tom,20
Jack,21

--preview-boundary--

### 保存数据集（需要使用 mysql Profile 启动）

POST http://localhost:8080/api/datasets
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=dataset-boundary

--dataset-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="student.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

name,age
Tom,20
Jack,21

--dataset-boundary--

### 查询已保存的数据集

GET http://localhost:8080/api/datasets/1

### 预览已保存的数据集

GET http://localhost:8080/api/datasets/1/preview?limit=10
